\tab - Add dropdowns for Make, Model, Year, Mileage, and Condition.\par
\tab - Add customer name and phone number fields.\par
\tab - Add validation for required fields and incorrect entries.\par
\tab - Prepare phone OTP verification through Twilio.\par
\tab - Ensure only confirmed phone numbers can submit.\par
\tab - Add the thank-you confirmation message after submission.\par
\tab - Keep the customer flow clear that no automatic price or valuation is shown at this stage.\par
\tab - Set up the Supabase database foundation under the CarVibeDubai Management account.\par
\tab - Prepare lead records, customer contact data, car details, CRM activity, and completed-sale data structure.\par
\tab - Prepare basic security rules so public visitors cannot access private lead data.\par
\tab - Prepare the data flow for the admin dashboard and CRM pipeline.\par
\par
Expected result by the end of this milestone:\par
\par
\tab - The public form is ready to collect customer details.\par
\tab - Phone verification and lead capture are prepared according to the signed scope.\par
\tab - The database structure is ready for the private dashboard and CRM tracking.\par
\par
Client input needed:\par
\par
\tab - Final car dropdown lists.\par
\tab - Final form field order.\par
\tab - Final thank-you message.\par
\tab - Twilio setup or access details.\par
\tab - Supabase account ownership/access details.\par
\tab - Confirmation of any optional fields such as location, preferred contact time, or car photos.\par
\par
