\par
\b\fs28 Simple Client Summary\b0\fs24\par
\par
Milestone 1 focuses on the public website.\par
Milestone 2 focuses on the customer form, OTP, and database.\par
Milestone 3 focuses on the private dashboard and CRM pipeline.\par
Milestone 4 focuses on notifications, settings, testing, launch preparation, and handover.\par
